config ANDROID_BPF_FD_LOADER
	tristate "Android BPF FD Loader Driver"
	depends on BPF_SYSCALL
	help
	  This option enables the Android BPF FD Loader kernel module.
	  The loader provides an IOCTL interface on /dev/bpf_fd_loader
	  to load BPF programs and maps using BPF light skeletons.

	  If built as a module, it will be called bpf_fd_loader.ko.
